      "message": "`new HashMap\u003c\u003e(estimatedSize)` allocates a map with capacity `estimatedSize`. Because HashMap default load factor is 0.75, the map will resize/rehash when the number of elements exceeds `estimatedSize * 0.75`. Consider using `Maps.newHashMapWithExpectedSize(estimatedSize)` to prevent rehashing.",
